  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to provide targeted cash transfers and training for persons with disabilities in nine Northern districts in Sri Lanka as part of Government of Sri Lanka&#x2019;s effort to improve the livelihoods of disabled persons.</narrative>
